#   access_summary -- the launcher's login file, rendered by the deploy and read
#                   back by the acceptance suites that sign in with it.
#   capacity     -- resource.Quantity parsing and the memory readings the lane
#                   gate and the pre-flight capacity check both judge.
#   composition  -- which apps a profile deploys by default, from apps.yaml.
#   envfile      -- every tool parses an operator's env file the same way.
#   profiles     -- the deploy MODES and what follows from one (broker, substrate
#                   charts, capacity floor); the bootstrap smoke tests read the
#                   same table through a generated shell fragment.
#   resolve_pins -- `pin`, so the standalone tool and `dfe-ops pin` are one code
#                   path (dfe-infra#116).
#   tester_idp   -- `idp`, whose render functions are unit-testable cluster-free.
